### Health
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

### Create order event
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "customer-101",
  "itemSku": "SKU-KAFKA-BOOK",
  "quantity": 1,
  "amount": 799.00
}

### Change order status
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders/REPLACE_WITH_ORDER_ID/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "PAYMENT_CONFIRMED"
}

### View tracked consumed events
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tracked-events

### View order read model
GET http://localhost:8080/api/order-projections
